# 新接口开发

## 一、开发顺序

新增一个接口必须按以下顺序：

1. 在 `java-tech.md` 或对应 `12-Java模块开发文档.mdc` 中确认接口契约
2. 写 Request DTO / Response VO
3. 写 Mapper 方法（如需要）
4. 写 Service 方法（业务逻辑）
5. 写 Controller
6. 写测试（集成测试 + 必要时单元测试）
7. 跑 `./mvnw verify`，回写文档与 `workflow.md`

不允许：先写 Controller 占位后再回头补 Service / Mapper。

---

## 二、Request / Response 模型

### 2.1 Request DTO

```java
public record CreateUserRequest(
    @NotBlank String username,
    @Email String email,
    @Size(min = 6, max = 64) String password
) {
}
```

约定：

- 一个 Request 一个文件（或同领域合并到 `XxxRequest.java`）
- 字段名与 API 文档完全一致
- 不在 Request 中暴露内部字段（如 `passwordHash`、`createdAt`）

### 2.2 Response VO

```java
public record UserResponse(
    Long id,
    String username,
    String email,
    String createdAt
) {
}
```

---

## 三、Service 方法

```java
@Service
public class UserService {
    private static final Logger log = LoggerFactory.getLogger(UserService.class);
    private final UserMapper userMapper;

    public UserService(UserMapper userMapper) {
        this.userMapper = userMapper;
    }

    @Transactional(rollbackFor = Exception.class)
    public UserResponse create(CreateUserRequest req) {
        UserEntity existing = userMapper.selectByEmail(req.email());
        if (existing != null) {
            throw new BusinessException(2001, "email already used");
        }

        String passwordHash = BCrypt.hashpw(req.password(), BCrypt.gensalt());
        UserEntity entity = new UserEntity();
        entity.setUsername(req.username());
        entity.setEmail(req.email());
        entity.setPasswordHash(passwordHash);
        userMapper.insert(entity);
        log.info("user created: {}", entity.getId());
        return UserMapperSupport.toResponse(entity);
    }
}
```

约定：

- Service 方法签名清晰：参数是 DTO 或基础类型，返回 VO
- 业务规则集中：参数校验 → 业务前置检查 → Mapper 调用 → 后置处理
- 错误抛 `IllegalArgumentException` / `BusinessException` / `NotFoundException`

---

## 四、Controller 接入

```java
@RestController
@RequestMapping("/api/users")
public class UserController {
    private final UserService service;

    public UserController(UserService service) {
        this.service = service;
    }

    @PostMapping
    public ApiResponse<UserResponse> create(@Valid @RequestBody CreateUserRequest req) {
        return ApiResponse.success(service.create(req));
    }
}
```

---

## 五、测试

### 5.1 集成测试（MockMvc）

```java
@SpringBootTest
@AutoConfigureMockMvc
class UserControllerTest {
    @Autowired
    private MockMvc mockMvc;

    @Test
    void createUserReturns0OnSuccess() throws Exception {
        mockMvc.perform(post("/api/users")
                .contentType(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON)
                .content("{\"username\":\"alice\",\"email\":\"a@b.com\",\"password\":\"123456\"}"))
            .andExpect(status().isOk())
            .andExpect(jsonPath("$.code").value(0));
    }
}
```

### 5.2 单元测试（Service）

```java
class UserServiceTest {
    @Test
    void createUserFailsOnDuplicateEmail() {
        UserMapper mapper = Mockito.mock(UserMapper.class);
        UserEntity existing = new UserEntity();
        existing.setId(1L);
        existing.setEmail("a@b.com");
        when(mapper.selectByEmail("a@b.com")).thenReturn(existing);

        UserService service = new UserService(mapper);
        BusinessException ex = assertThrows(
            BusinessException.class,
            () -> service.create(new CreateUserRequest("alice", "a@b.com", "123456"))
        );
        assertEquals(2001, ex.getCode());
    }
}
```

